  PointLParams: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  volumesIntensityControlsNote: The main controls of the volumes intensity are the
    LightControlA.x for the directional light and the LightControlA.y for the Spot
    and Point lights. Note that LightControlA.x is a multiplier of intensity, and
    the LightControlA.y is an intensity divider, thus the higher the value, the lower
    the local lights intensity, so use a high value if the scene if very bright.
